      <title>从“用了多少AI”到“Token效”：企业AI投入评估尺子已换</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260901/%E4%BB%8E%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%86%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%91AI%E5%88%B0Token%E6%95%88%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9AAI%E6%8A%95%E5%85%A5%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%E5%B0%BA%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%B2%E6%8D%A2/</link>
